# Game over in world 2 with no high score, back to the title, a new game: no dropped frames
# (coordinator's note, 2026-11-13). At the title worldLoad(0) loads world 1's art back, but the title's
# copper pass does not write the game lists, so they stay marked for a full write; the next game start
# (or the attract loop's hall of fame) then rewrites both lists with the bitplanes on and likely drops
# about 2 frames. Expected RED until amiga-hw's fix (update the game lists when s_ubRasterOff is set
# at the title). Skill 5 (short tells), mission 4: hover low at the gunboat, lose all 3 choppers.
wait-serial "AGK t0" 1000
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x11
wait 5
key 0x04
wait-serial "AGK world 2 loaded" 400
key 0x63
key 0x28
wait 5
key 0x05
wait 5
press fire 2
wait 40
press up 20
press left 395
wait-serial "chopper lost" 2500
wait 200
press up 20
press left 395
wait-serial "chopper lost" 2500
wait 200
press up 20
press left 395
wait-serial "chopper lost" 2500
wait-serial "AGK world 1 loaded" 900
wait 100
press fire 2
wait 200
press fire 2
wait 300
screenshot newgame
expect-no-serial "ERR|missing"
expect-no-dropped-frames
